,"path":"servers/rendering/renderer_rd/forward_clustered/render_forward_clustered.cpp","commit_id":"8ed6ef8777a542ed856510167c5ef017ad708273","original_commit_id":"28c7be13d74352721b3c485397c7e78a555dcfe5","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"For our cluster debug shader, we don't currently have a stereo debug mode and likely wont ever need it. So this code makes the assumption the debug shader is only ever used in mono rendering.\nIf this ever turns out to be untrue, we'll need bigger changes, but it would have been broken already before our checks became stricter.","created_at":"2026-07-03T01:31:49Z","updated_at":"2026-07-03T01:31:49Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120876#discussion_r3516935921","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120876","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3516935921"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120876#discussion_r3516935921"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.git